{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the blood-soaked boots of Shevchenko, a battle-hardened nurse caught in the chaos of a zombie apocalypse.</strong><br>As the world crumbles, Shevchenko clings to one fragile hope \u2014 finding a cure. To do so, she must brave ruined cities, explore mysterious dungeons, and face off against grotesque undead nightmares. Survival is no guarantee. Curiosity is your only compass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn\u2019t just your average dungeon crawler. Between ambushes and scavenging, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that <strong>reveal hidden sides of your personality</strong>\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2306960/extras/d969aa75970d745ae0b479259272de4f.avif?t=1754034406\" width=386 height=480 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based dungeon-crawling RPG with a post-apocalyptic twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bizarre personality quizzes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, gear up, and face a terrifying variety of zombies and monsters</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survived through day 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2306960/320df69491294f050982ca332d4408156bd9cf2c.jpg"},{"name":"Survived through day 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2306960/285c1c07aa5864273656c1d8e5886ef9a207c6df.jpg"},{"name":"Survived through day 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2306960/0fc08e620ee8c967d4ec92fb1e48f1a11ca2fafa.jpg"},{"name":"Survived through day 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2306960/a2470d77bdfd6de9737218